<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><title>Upgrade Alerts · bitcoin++</title>{{ block "header" . }}{{ end }}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/shop.css?v=20260718-11"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/service-checkout.css?v=4"></head>
<body class="shop-page alerts-upgrade-page">{{ block "mainnav" . }}{{ end }}
<main class="service-checkout service-checkout--account">
<nav class="service-account-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a></li><li><a href="/dashboard/subscriptions">Subscriptions</a></li><li><a href="/services/alerts/manage">Alerts billing</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Increase subscription</span></li></ol></nav>
<section class="service-checkout-content">
<header class="service-checkout__head"><span class="service-kicker">bitcoin++ Alerts</span><h1>Upgrade your alerts</h1></header>
<p role="status">{{ .Message }}</p>

{{ if .CanConfirm }}<p>Confirming authorizes the prorated charge using your saved payment method. Additional authentication may be required.</p>
<form method="post" class="alerts-upgrade-action"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="confirm">{{ with .Policy }}
<details><summary>Read the Terms of Service · {{ .Version }}</summary><div style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ .TermsText }}</div></details>
<details><summary>Read the Privacy Policy · {{ .Version }}</summary><div style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{ .PrivacyText }}</div></details>
<input type="hidden" name="legal_version" value="{{ .Version }}">
<label><input type="checkbox" name="accept_terms" value="yes" required> I agree to these Terms of Service and acknowledge the Privacy Policy.</label>
{{ end }}<button type="submit" class="service-primary">Confirm upgrade · {{ .Charge }}</button></form>{{ end }}
{{ if .CanPay }}<form method="post" class="alerts-upgrade-action"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ .CSRF }}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="pay"><button type="submit" class="service-primary">Complete payment with Stripe</button></form>{{ end }}
<p class="alerts-upgrade-links"><a href="/services/alerts/manage">Manage billing</a> · <a href="https://alerts.btcpp.dev/alerts">My alerts</a></p>
</section><aside class="service-summary" aria-label="Order summary"><img src="/static/img/alerts-checkout.svg" alt="" width="640" height="360"><div class="service-summary__body"><h2><span class="service-wordmark">bitcoin++</span> Alerts</h2><dl class="alerts-upgrade-summary"><div><dt>Paid project subscriptions</dt><dd>{{ .Previous }} → {{ .Desired }}<small>Plus your three free projects</small></dd></div>
<div><dt>Prorated upgrade charge</dt><dd>{{ .Charge }}<small>Through {{ .Period }}</small></dd></div>
<div><dt>Included tax</dt><dd>{{ .Tax }}</dd></div>
<div><dt>New annual total</dt><dd>{{ .Annual }}<small>Including applicable tax</small></dd></div></dl></div></aside></main></body></html>
